  "fill_rate": {
   "_about": "Phase 10 Stage 1.1, approved: fill ships the guide B5 LightGBM-22 on FLAT graph features with NO identity keys, replacing the depth-0 point-mass head. It is not a neural head: no arch/depth/lr, no seed band, no per-window recalibration temperature to maintain.",
