 "drift_bands_pp": {
  "_about": "Excess drift = |model drift - h0 drift| under the same incoming inputs, in percentage points of the task's drift statistic. Bands from Addendum B's arrival table (week-ECE after recalibration): <=0.5 -> 0.015-0.022; 1.5-2.0 -> 0.043-0.054; 4.5-5.2 -> 0.105-0.124. The 0.5-1.0 'watch' band is interpolation, not measured. Applied ONLY to tasks with drift_bands_apply = true (arrival): the bands were measured on arrival's P(T > 12), a probability. Capacity's statistic is mean P50 utilisation, so its 'pp' are hundredths of a utilisation unit and these thresholds do not transfer; fill ships as h0 and has no reference to exceed.",
  "usable": 0.5,
  "watch": 1.0,
  "degraded": 4.5
 },
